    "solid_arrow": "AP transmission target for the recorded action (relay if relay differs from intended UE); an attempted action, not a delivery guarantee.",
    "purple_dashed_arrow": "D2D link active this slot, scheduled by the previous slot's action.",
    "orange_dashed_arrow": "Relay-to-target D2D plan for the next slot, not a simultaneous completed hop.",
